#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607256"
msgid "―――, ―――♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614200"
msgid "*sigh*. We've finally been set free.\nIs she planning to make that tasteless show\ninto a series?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615588"
msgid "A dress code exists here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615628"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF. I will have you become free.\nThe extra will be cut out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615732"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616232"
msgid "Ridiculous!\nWho would want to see―――\nn-no. Bad, bad thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616920"
msgid "I don't get what she mea―no, I don't get this\nportrayal of #C236196003Rani#CDEF at all…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617032"
msgid "And look, I don't want to change MY clothes…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617504"
msgid "I don't get what she mea―no, I don't get this\nportrayal of #C236196003Rani#CDEF at all…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617616"
msgid "And why is #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF grinning at me…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617812"
msgid "Pfft―――ahahahaha!\nMan, I guess you just have to do it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618340"
msgid "And he's the only resource we have to stop #C236196003Leo#CDEF too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618408"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF has departed off to a separate matter.\nBut rest assured, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF is always by\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF's side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618772"
msgid "#C000246204Take off my Mystic Code#CDEF…\nWell, compared to stripping down to only my underwear…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619280"
msgid "As if this duo would ever seriously keep quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619620"
msgid "It's about whether you'll take mental damage\nor physical damage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619792"
msgid "…oh man."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "620276"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 1"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "620296"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 2"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "620360"
msgid "Until this floor is cleared,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "620392"
msgid "the lock cannot be lifted."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "620444"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 1"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "620464"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 2"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620636"
msgid "Now strip."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620656"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621184"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF…\nHasn't she explained it to you?"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "621404"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 1"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "621424"
msgid "Mystic Code slot 2"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "621488"
msgid "Until this floor is cleared,"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
