msgid "Mystic Code slot 2"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621752"
msgid "Hmhmhm. At long last, here it is…\nThe long antcipat―err, dreaded third door!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621896"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622136"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622728"
msgid "Truthfully?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622772"
msgid "Are there variations of nude? Knee socks nude;\nglasses nude; syrup nude; giant nude?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622928"
msgid "Please take off just your underwear.\nThen this door will open."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623008"
msgid "Wh―――whaaaaatttt!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623172"
msgid "Take. Off. The. Underwear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623480"
msgid "…Praetor. There is no other way. You have\nto accept #C236196003Rani#CDEF's demand. However, this is more\nobscene than artistic…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623844"
msgid "…………\n……………………\n………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624092"
msgid "―――Oww!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624108"
msgid "…I apologize, Darling…\nI know how you feel, but this is #C236196003Rani#CDEF's\nstrange Labyrinth… We can only obey her…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624360"
msgid "―――Oww!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624792"
msgid "…………\n……………………\n………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "624896"
msgid "Don't be like that. It's not that kind of event.\nGo on, don't think… Just do it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625260"
msgid "―――Huh!?\nI-I didn't say anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625380"
msgid "……………\nI'm begging you, don't look at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625624"
msgid "―――Owww!?\nUuugh, again…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625736"
msgid "*kgh*… Is no one on my side!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625768"
msgid "But the truth is that I can't proceed\nunless I do as #C236196003Rani#CDEF says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "625868"
msgid "Good day.\nHow do you feel?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "625984"
msgid "……best?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "626000"
msgid "……natural?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "626020"
msgid "……condition?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "626428"
msgid "It's not a hobby or preference, let alone an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nof mine. It's purely an academic interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627232"
msgid "…ahem. As you saw, to win over my opponent's\nServant… That was my true aim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627420"
msgid "This is clearly linked to the\n\"secret #C236196003Rani#CDEF is hiding.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "627584"
msgid "Regardless, I feel like I caught on to #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628012"
msgid "Match… match, match…\n…I'm surprised. I didn't think of it that way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628096"
msgid "Yes―――right now, we're both staring at the\ndefenseless other―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628368"
msgid "―――I got it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628460"
msgid "Now the Shield should disappear…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "628840"
msgid "You mean to say… that #C236196003Rani#CDEF wanted #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nto learn what's bad about herself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629088"
msgid "……yes. Though AI have a duty to report their\ndefects, they wouldn't normally think about\nreceiving those reports."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "629976"
msgid "This singing―#C236196003Lancer#CDEF…!\nStay alert, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630040"
msgid "Hm! There's a sudden reptilian presence!\nLooks like that lizard woman showed up without\nan invitation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630452"
msgid "The commando diva who's been all over the Moon,\n#C236196003Eli#CDEF… rather, the special #C000246204Idol#CDEF class Servant,\nmakes her appearance!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630716"
msgid "No fair!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "630876"
msgid "Idyll…? Hmm. For some reason, this noun sounds\nromantic… How about we make a class change?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631332"
msgid "I agree with what #C236196003Archer#CDEF said.\nThere's no such \"Idol\" class."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631720"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF glared at us with a blazing gaze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631792"
msgid "A chill runs up my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "631824"
msgid "…it looks like she completely locked on to us\nafter we extracted so many #C000246204SGs#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632392"
msgid "Rock on Japan! If we HAVE to listen, then the\ngods Houtei and Benten won't lose to some\nWestern, electric string instrument!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632720"
msgid "Huh? Why did I come here, you ask?\nIsn't it obvious? I can't just\nallow you to change up your costume."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632828"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "632848"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633100"
msgid "I dressed up while I ran, ate toast while\nI dressed up, and did my nails while\nI ate toast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633284"
msgid "I get what you mean, but…\n……………seriously?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "633740"
msgid "Get it? I'm going FULL POWER! I'll skewer you\nlike when I dig into a fresh salad and take my\nsweet time slicing and dicing you up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634472"
msgid "Ow, ow…!\nDid her spear get one rank heavier!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "634844"
msgid "Tsk. Cheeky, aren't you…!\nAnd fighting two on one? You COWARDS!\nNow I'm all sweaty―I'm leaving!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635324"
msgid "Hmph. Why are you acting tough? You still can't\neven use your #C000246204Noble Phantasm#CDEF.\nYou really think you can beat me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635452"
msgid "Grr―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635464"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635476"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635628"
msgid "Hehe―――\nFor a pig, you seem to catch on quick.\nThat's right. I STILL went easy on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "635992"
msgid "Leaving with a sneer, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF teleported away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636304"
msgid "#C000246204Noble Phantasm#CDEF――#C000246204Noble Phantasm#CDEF, huh?\nBut… my Praetor has forgotten my True Name――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636596"
msgid "It's fine. Please don't let it concern you,\n#RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637000"
msgid "I feebly nod to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's consolation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637068"
msgid "Regardless, we managed to repel #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nAll we can do now is recover our experience,\nlittle by little."
msgstr ""

